ily beat the ♥J with a low-risk move, I should do so.\n\nBest move: play **♠Q** — it beats the current play, conserves my ♠A, and maintains pressure without overcommitting.\n\nReason: Playing ♠Q beats the landlord’s ♥J efficiently while preserving higher-value cards like ♠A for future critical plays. Passing would shift unnecessary burden to my teammate, and playing ♠A would waste a high card when a lower one suffices.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠Q"]}'}
